{
  "_doc": "R4 golden CLIENT-SDK emissions (spec 009 §3). One physical fixture set consumed by the client SDK conformance tests AND the ingest tests. Each entry is the EXPECTED wire envelope shape the client SDK emits for a given capture verb, with STATIC ids (evt-*, s-*) as placeholders — the SDK mints ULIDs at runtime, so conformance asserts SHAPE + field-names + the fixed non-id fields, never the exact minted ids. game_id / server_received_time / client_sent_time are DELIBERATELY ABSENT (the client never sends them; the transport stamps client_sent_time at flush).",
  "emissions": [
